# Bases

## Objective
Decode a Base64 encoded string.

## Solution

- Identified the encoded text as Base64.
- Decoded it using CyberChef (`From Base64`).
- Retrieved the original text and submitted it in the picoCTF flag format.

## What I Learned

- Base64 is an encoding method, not encryption.
- How to recognize and decode Base64 using CyberChef and Linux.
